<title>UK: British Biotech finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>British Biotech finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Biotech Plc said on Thursday that James Noble has resigned as finance director with immediate effect and is leaving the company.  </p>
<p>Noble said in a statement, &quot;British Biotech is now fully funded through to commercialisation, which means that my principal objective as finance director has been achieved&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
